><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D407 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\" movablelimits=\"true\">det</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">H</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<p><em>Hint: in (a) and (b), factor scalars out of whole rows and\ncolumns using multilinearity.</em></p>","file":"ch07-determinants/08-special-determinants.html"}